    "description": "In this video, Chef John shows you how to make holiday ham and potato casserole using only one pound of ham. The recipe is perfect for a large table full of hungry people on a tight budget, and also for using up the leftovers if you have a whole ham. The video gives step-by-step instructions for making a simple cream sauce with onions, butter, flour, heavy cream, and milk. Once the sauce is ready, potatoes are sliced and assembled in a large deep casserole dish, alternating with layers of sauce and ham. The casserole is topped with the remaining sauce and baked until golden brown and ready to serve for dinner!",
